# Used only by the samples/CronTestApp docker build, whose build context is this repository root.
# Keeps build/IDE artifacts and secrets out of the image context.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/.git/
artifacts/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
# The real .env is provided at runtime via docker compose env_file, never baked into the image.
**/.env
